WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.314
In tutorial 11.8, you'll show your
clients your own name, logo and colour,

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:12.759
on an address of your own.

00:00:13.789 --> 00:00:16.864
First, open Company settings,
and choose Branding.

00:00:19.268 --> 00:00:24.135
Switch on White-label, so your clients see
your name, logo and colour, and not ours.

00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:29.718
Then add your product name, your
brand colour and your logo address,

00:00:29.768 --> 00:00:32.875
with a second logo for dark
backgrounds if you have one.

00:00:33.915 --> 00:00:37.365
Add the support e-mail and the
footer line your clients see.

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:40.062
Showing Powered by Alaventra is up to you.

00:00:41.077 --> 00:00:44.122
Next, check the preview
in light and dark mode.

00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:47.097
It shows that every
text stays easy to read.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.826
Then click Save branding.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:54.010
Now open Portal address. Type
an address on your own domain,

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:57.219
like a sub-domain of your
website, and click Add address.

00:00:58.248 --> 00:01:02.773
Add the two records it shows where you
manage your domain, and click Check now.

00:01:02.823 --> 00:01:06.934
A ready address shows as Verified,
with Open the portal beside it.

00:01:07.918 --> 00:01:12.203
Then open Client e-mail. Set the
sender name your clients see,

00:01:12.253 --> 00:01:14.947
and the reply-to address
where their answers go.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:19.067
Under Send from, choose our
address with your sender name,

00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:22.890
or your own address once it's
verified. Then click Save.

00:01:23.863 --> 00:01:27.788
To give one client its own brand,
open that client's workspace,

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:30.010
then Company settings, and Branding.

00:01:30.994 --> 00:01:35.209
Under This client's brand, set a
different name, colour or logo.

00:01:35.259 --> 00:01:38.631
Leave a field empty to use
your agency's, and click Save.

00:01:39.655 --> 00:01:42.780
Now your clients meet your
brand everywhere, in the portal,

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.817
their reports and their e-mails.

00:01:46.126 --> 00:01:49.721
So, add your name, logo and
colour, check the preview,

00:01:49.771 --> 00:01:52.786
put the portal on your own
address, set your client e-mail,

00:01:52.836 --> 00:01:54.478
and brand single clients.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:02:00.332
Your portal, your brand. Next, ask
a client to approve a page or pitch,

00:02:00.382 --> 00:02:02.422
in tutorial 11.9.
